{title: Lafzon Mein Keh Na Sakoon}
{artist: Abhijeet Sawant}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m]Lafzon mein [G#m]keh naa sakoon,        [C#]Bin keh bhi [A#m]reh naa sakoon
[D#m]Nasha hi nasha raat [C#]din hai,        [G#m]Na puncho ye kaisa pyar [E]hai [C#]
[D#m]Lafzon me [G#m]keh naa sakoon,        [C#]Bin keh bhi [A#m]reh na sakun [D#m]
[D#m]Halki si barsaat mein,        [D#m]Pehli mulakat [C#]mein
Pehli [G#m]baar mein,        Dil ko mere [A#m]le gayi
Chaahat ke [G#m]iqraar mein,        Anjaana ghum [F#]de ga [C#]yi
Aayee jab [G#m]saamne,        Jaane kya woh [A#m]kar gayi
Paagal mujhko [G#m]kar gayi,        Jaaneman Jaane [C#]jaan
[D#m]Na jaane [G#m]kya baat hai,        [C#]Lage ke [A#m]din mein raat hai
[D#m]Nayee hai subah to nayi [C#]shaam,        [G#m]Ajab haal mera yaar [E]hai [C#]
[D#m]Lafzon mein [G#m]keh naa sakoon,        [C#]Bin keh bhi [A#m]reh
Mera [C#]dil,meri [D#m]jaan,        Main [C#]yahan tu hai [G#m]kahaan
[D#m]Main dekhu mudke jidhar,        [D#m]Aaye mujhe tu [C#]nazar
Kehti hai [G#m]chaahate,        Deewana main [A#m]ho gaya
Teri chaahat [G#m]mein sanam,        Naa jaane kab [F#]kho ga [C#]ya
Yeh kaisa [G#m]hai asar,        Mujhko naa it [A#m]ni khabar
Kab jaaga kab [G#m]so gaya,        Jaaneman Jaane [C#]jaan
[D#m]Lafzon mein [G#m]keh naa sakoon,        [C#]Bin keh bhi [A#m]reh naa sakoon
[D#m]Nasha hi nasha raat [C#]din hai,        [G#m]Na puncho ye kaisa pyar [E]hai [C#]
[D#m]Lafzon me [G#m]keh naa sakoon,        [C#]Bin keh bhi [A#m]reh na sakun [D#m]
